                                                "sense_id": "8bb43627-5590-31a1-9109-38083213d78b",
                                                "text": "Laymen speak of ‘a writer’s block’ as if it were singular and are often encouraged in this fallacy by authors who are understandably reluctant to discuss something as personal as mental impotence. There are many kinds of writers’ blocks and probably as many reasons for blocks as there are reasons for writing, […]"
